Client ID and Client Secret here**. I'll then:\n- configure them in Vercel env (without echoing them anywhere) and locally\n- redeploy, and run the full real OAuth loop verified end-to-end with you\n- after that you can connect on the live site and see your actual calendar events + real Meet calls\n\nDeploy checks passed (book/live/API routes 200, all 27 Playwright checks green, no page errors). The only thing left is pasting the credentials."}
